    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are adept at quickly changing a creature's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a> toward you.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intimidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Change_Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Change Attitude\">Change Attitude</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> To <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intimidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Change_Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Change Attitude\">Change Attitude</a> requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>.</p>",
